      "Test split : Xin=(1000, 128, 128), Xout=(1000, 128, 128)\n",
      "Seed radial-kernel baseline metrics:\n",
      "  Val  | AUC=0.553661 ACC@0.5=0.534091 ACC@thr_val=0.598086 (thr_val=0.510)\n",
