   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Spike-Free Smooth Signed Radial Kernel Training (Progressive Block Locking)\n",
    "\n",
    "This section implements progressive block-wise training for the first 21 bins (radius 0 to 20). Every 5 epochs, the active training window shifts: we lock the previously trained bins (by zeroing out their gradients) and train the next group of 4 bins. The outer bins (indices 21 to 89) remain frozen to the seed profile. Smoothness and curvature regularization are calculated on the concatenated **full** profile to maintain continuity across all boundaries."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "d03e2cae",
